# Citation metadata for PhyloRecViewer (Citation CFF 1.2.0).
#
# The three dates that exist for this software, stated once so they no longer
# have to be guessed from different places:
#   * the source revision behind the first archive (commit a65c8f3, tag v0.1.0)
#     was published as a GitHub release on 2026-09-29 (published_at
#     2026-09-29T14:45:25Z);
#   * the Zenodo record archiving that tag carries publication_date 2026-09-30,
#     i.e. the day the *record* was deposited (version DOI 10.5281/zenodo.23053318)
#     — the archive, not the commit, sets that date;
#   * `date-released` below is the release date of the version THIS FILE SHIPS IN,
#     which is the only date a reader of the repository needs.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite: Zeng, Z., & Wang, Y. (2026). PhyloRecViewer (v0.1.1)
  [Computer software]. Zenodo. https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.23053317
title: PhyloRecViewer
abstract: "Offline, interactive recPhyloXML / NHX phylogenetic-reconciliation
  viewer: gene trees embedded in species tube-maps, three-level nesting,
  event-level comparison, and vector export that reproduces the on-screen view."
type: software
